OL,3,GNEWSAWhat's the story behind plan for  
OL,4,AJapanese cultural hub in Norwich?      
OL,6,FA community group is planning to       
OL,7,Fbreathe new life into a vacant former  
OL,8,Flibrary by turning it into a cultural  
OL,9,Fhub inspired by Japanese stories.      
OL,11,FThe not-for-profit Japan in Norwich    
OL,12,Fgroup is working with the city council 
OL,13,Fto take over the Old Library building. 
OL,15,FProf Simon Kaner, director of Japan in 
OL,16,FNorwich, has explained how the city's  
OL,17,Fconnections with the East Asian country
OL,18,Fgo back more than 150 years.           
OL,20,FHe said the project would give these   
OL,21,Fstories "a home in the heart of the    
OL,22,Fcity".                                 
